'''Aspect of Arakaali''' is a Pantheon [[aspect]] skill that grants a [[buff]] which inflicts {{stl|Withered}} on hit, but causes Wither you inflict to be reflected back to you, and grants increased life recovery rate per Wither stack on you. Only one aspect skill can be active at a time.

==Mechanics==
This buff is a source of guaranteed Wither on hit. Using [[proxies]] to inflict wither will still reflect wither to the character.

Modifiers to your Wither effect will affect the reflected Wither. It is recommended to have some protection or prevention against [[chaos damage]], such as {{psl|Chaos Inoculation}} or {{stl|Excommunicated}}.

Alternatively, {{il|Tainted Pact}} with {{il|The Golden Rule}} synergizes well by causing your [[poison]]'s damage and life recovery to scale from wither effect and life recovery rate respectively.

Aspect of Arakaali cannot be supported by {{il|Enlighten Support}}.

==Acquisition==
Aspect of Arakaali is obtained exclusively by using {{il|Brinehook's Ducat}} during [[Allflame crafting]].

